Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.35,0:00:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}街机恐龙快打的第一关
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.30,0:00:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}这回能钻进主角的眼睛里打
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.80,0:00:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}左轮在手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.96,0:00:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}胖子迎面冲过来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.48,0:00:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}连开几枪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.65,0:00:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}我把卡普空九三年的这一关
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.72,0:00:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}做成了3D重置版
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.65,0:00:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}默认是侧视
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.96,0:00:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}跟当年街机厅里一样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.68,0:00:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}维斯放完狠话跳楼跑路
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.80,0:00:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}手下围了上来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.65,0:00:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}按一下C
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.78,0:00:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}镜头转到主角身后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.49,0:00:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}这就是正视
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.86,0:00:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}W就是往前走
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.81,0:00:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}敌人从正前方迎上来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.54,0:00:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}谁先走进拳头范围
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.21,0:00:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}一眼就看得出来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.78,0:00:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}代价是背后看不见
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.98,0:00:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}你看
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.90,0:00:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}后面上来一个
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.05,0:00:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}挨了一下才发现
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.25,0:00:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}再按一下C
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.34,0:00:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}第一人称
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.62,0:00:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}拳头就在眼前
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.21,0:00:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}敌人的脸也贴在眼前
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.62,0:00:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}最后一脚
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.71,0:00:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}踹开楼梯间的门
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.65,0:00:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}进了大楼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.79,0:00:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}正视看走廊特别有纵深
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.95,0:00:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}可两边的门会突然出人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.92,0:00:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}这一下被三个人夹在门边
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.41,0:00:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}背后那个根本看不见
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.08,0:00:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}血条直接见底
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.05,0:01:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}好在默认是无限命
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.86,0:01:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}原地复活
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.19,0:01:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}落地还能把身边的人震倒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.05,0:01:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}走廊里再切第一人称
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.64,0:01:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}拿刀的布雷德正面走过来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.05,0:01:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}刀子就在眼前晃
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.71,0:01:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}打倒他会掉左轮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.58,0:01:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}就是开头那几枪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.31,0:01:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}等胖子们一起挤上来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.26,0:01:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}满屏都是肚子
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.95,0:01:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}撞破窗户
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.14,0:01:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}跳到第47街
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.06,0:01:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}一路打到尽头
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.60,0:01:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}维斯牵着锁住的岩跳龙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.71,0:01:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}就堵在正前方
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.40,0:01:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}他抽了恐龙一鞭
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.95,0:01:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}恐龙当场变成橙色
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.16,0:01:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}暴走了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.75,0:01:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}正视打Boss
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.98,0:01:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}维斯和恐龙都在正前方
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.12,0:01:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}谁先扑过来看得很清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.60,0:01:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}当然
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.62,0:01:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}看清楚不代表躲得开
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.95,0:01:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}切到第一人称
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.41,0:01:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}恐龙的牙直接怼到脸上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.98,0:01:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}再贴近一点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.24,0:01:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}镜头干脆钻进了恐龙嘴里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.70,0:01:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}这是个bug
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.86,0:01:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}已经记下了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.16,0:01:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}维斯一掉血就叫手下帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.86,0:01:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}这一拳砸过来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.21,0:02:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}又倒了一次
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.95,0:02:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}最后切回侧视收尾
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.08,0:02:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}左右两边的人都看得见
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.95,0:02:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}飞踢什么时候出、往哪边躲
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.50,0:02:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}心里更有数
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.01,0:02:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}难怪原作用的是这个视角
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.40,0:02:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}补上最后几下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.84,0:02:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}维斯终于倒下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.15,0:02:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}体力奖励结算
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.54,0:02:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}第一关通关
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.65,0:02:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}十二万两千四百分
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.94,0:02:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}这局穆斯塔法倒了三次
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.25,0:02:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}全靠默认的无限命
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.95,0:02:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}录像里还抓到一个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.05,0:02:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}正视贴着墙打
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.54,0:02:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}镜头会钻进砖墙里
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.64,0:02:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}这两个镜头问题
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.09,0:02:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}下次先修
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.95,0:02:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}侧视看得全，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.30,0:02:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}身后视角更有推进感，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.41,0:02:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}第一人称更贴近战斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.71,0:02:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}这是十月五日的开发实录。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.35,0:02:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}当前试玩见简介，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.98,0:02:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,810)}你更想用哪个视角？
